  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feeder Road Rehabilitation Project Corozal and Orange Walk Phase 2 Lot A</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract inherited from multiple actions, related to: Feeder Road Rehabilitation Project Corozal and Orange Walk Phase 2 Lot A - The purpose of this AAP is to advance the long-term EC support foreseen in the Multi-Annual EC Assistance Strategy (2006-13) and in particular, to make concrete steps towards improving the economic and social conditions through improving the rural road network, and develop implementation strategies to further improve the efficiency and competitiveness of sugarcane production and promote diversified rural economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
